.content-collections
# fumadocs' source index. `postinstall` writes the types and `next build`
# writes `index.js`, so a clean checkout regenerates all of it - verified by
# deleting the directory and building. It was tracked, and it should not have
# been: every entry carries the *absolute* path of whoever generated it, so
# two worktrees produce two different files and every merge between them
# conflicts on all of them at once. The entry order and the path count also
# move with the fumadocs version, which makes the committed copy wrong for
# anyone who did not generate it.
.source

